Upstream-Name: rsshterm
Comment: rsshterm links the Swift runtime and Swift packages statically (SwiftNIO, Swift Crypto with BoringSSL,
 SwiftNIO SSH, Citadel, RoyalVNCKit, CryptoSwift, BigInt, stb_image, ICU, ...). Their licence and NOTICE texts are in
 /usr/share/doc/rsshterm/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES (generated by packaging/licenses/generate.py). GTK 4, libadwaita, VTE,
 FreeRDP and the other shared libraries are not included: the package depends on the distribution's copies.
Source: https://github.com/radut/rsshterm

